<title>UK: Oester Kommunalkredit set 100 mln mark 4-year bond.</title>
<headline>Oester Kommunalkredit set 100 mln mark 4-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager DGZ.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OESTERREICHISCHE KOMMUNALKREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.625     MATURITY    13.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.025   PAY DATE    13.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.15	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    FRFT	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.50	LIST FEE    0.4</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
